  # The two female releases the optional backends compile (connectome.load(dataset="fafb" | "banc")).
  # Public Codex releases, CC BY 4.0; the files flyverse reads and their SHA-256 hashes are in
  # flyverse/data/manifest.json. Cite the original reconstruction papers alongside the release.
  - type: data
    title: "FlyWire FAFB v783: the adult Drosophila melanogaster female brain connectome (Codex public release)"
    authors:
      - name: "FlyWire Consortium"
    year: 2024
    version: "783"
    url: "https://codex.flywire.ai/"
    notes: "Princeton / FlyWire. Used as the complete female optic lobe and brain backend."

  - type: data
    title: "BANC v888: the adult Drosophila melanogaster female brain and ventral nerve cord connectome (Codex public release)"
    authors:
      - name: "FlyWire Consortium"
    year: 2025
    version: "888"
    url: "https://codex.flywire.ai/"
    notes: "Used as the whole-animal female backend, including verified transmitter calls."

  # The neuron model flyverse's LIF follows: v_rest = v_reset = -52 mV, v_th = -45 mV, tau_m = 20 ms,
  # tau_syn = 5 ms, refractory 2.2 ms, delay 1.8 ms, w = 0.275 mV x synapse count x sign (docs/NOTES.md).
  - type: article
    title: "A Drosophila computational brain model reveals sensorimotor processing"
